OL,3,CRichard Tice: Reform UK deputy leader
OL,4,Cfacing parliamentary investigation
OL,6,FRichard Tice is under investigation by
OL,7,FParliament's standards watchdog over
OL,8,Fan alleged failure to declare an
OL,9,Finterest.
OL,11,FThe investigation was opened on July
OL,12,F28 and was published on the
OL,13,FParliamentary Standards Commissioner
OL,14,Fwebsite on Monday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
