OL,3,CRichard Tice: Reform UK deputy leader
OL,4,Cfacing parliamentary investigation
OL,6,FIt comes after a separate
OL,7,Fparliamentary investigation was opened
OL,8,Finto party leader Nigel Farage's
OL,9,Freceipt of a #5 million gift from
OL,10,Fcrypto-billionaire Christopher
OL,11,FHarborne before he was elected.
OL,13,FThe inquiry was suspended after he
OL,14,Ftriggered a by-election by resigning
OL,15,Fin his Clacton seat in July.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
