PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785786508
OL,3,CRichard Tice: Reform UK deputy leader
OL,4,Cfacing parliamentary investigation
OL,6,FFarage has consistently argued the
OL,7,Fdonation was unrelated to his
OL,8,Fpolitical activities, saying last
OL,9,Fmonth that he was able to accept it
OL,10,Fbecause he "wasn't in politics"
OL,11,Fbetween 2021 and June 2024.
OL,13,FHowever, a Sunday Times report over
OL,14,Fthe weekend suggested he had struck a
OL,15,Fsecret deal to return as leader of
OL,16,FReform UK months before the 2024
OL,17,FGeneral Election.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
