PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785786508
OL,3,CRichard Tice: Reform UK deputy leader
OL,4,Cfacing parliamentary investigation
OL,6,FAccording to the Sunday Times, Farage
OL,7,Fnegotiated a deal with Tice, who was
OL,8,Fthen party chief, in March and April
OL,9,F2024, to return as leader.
OL,11,FUnder that deal, Farage planned to
OL,12,Frepay or write off more than #1
OL,13,Fmillion in outstanding loans it had
OL,14,Freceived from Tice's company.
OL,16,FFarage received the gift from Mr
OL,17,FHarborne in April 2024, according to
OL,18,FThe Guardian.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
