OL,3,CRichard Tice: Reform UK deputy leader
OL,4,Cfacing parliamentary investigation
OL,6,FOn Monday morning, Farage told a press
OL,7,Fconference he decided to run after
OL,8,FRishi Sunak called the election in May
OL,9,F2024, insisting he had not intended to
OL,10,Freturn to politics.
OL,12,FHe said: "More guilt was piled upon me
OL,13,Fand I reluctantly, at the last minute,
OL,14,Fchanged my mind. But no, I had no,
OL,15,Fthere was no plan to come back at all.
OL,16,FThere were lots of people asking me
OL,17,Fto. All right, simple as that."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
